{ "Identifier":       { "ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "MMC-MPD-V2.5-I01", "AIMName": "MMC-MPD-V2.5" },

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Multimodal Personal Status-based Dialogue: dialogue that perceives both the MEANING and the FEELING of the human and responds accordingly. It recognises the speech (Automatic Speech Recognition), understands it (Natural Language Understanding: Text Descriptors + Text Personal Status), reads the emotion in the voice (Entity Speech Interpretation: Speech Personal Status), fuses the per-modality Personal Statuses into one Entity Personal Status (Personal Status Multiplexing), processes the dialogue turn aware of the meaning and the person's Personal Status (Entity Dialogue Processing, a local LLM), and renders the response as a Speaking Avatar (Response and Scene Rendering). It is MMC-MAD preceded by NLU + Personal Status Extraction (ESI + PSM); the running Summary threads context across turns. Personal Status is extracted from speech + text here (no camera); Face Personal Status can be added when a visual edge is present.",

